  "node": {
    "id": "ctkg:v3e-object-0005c17b837d3fc1abc69c23",
    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "系统的稳态误差取决于 L(s)=G_c(s)G(s)H(s) 在原点处的极点数。原点处的极点可视为积分环节，因此系统的稳态精度最终取决于回路传递函数中积分环节的个数。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "The steady-state error of a system depends on the number of poles at the origin for L(s)=G_c(s)G(s)H(s). A pole at the origin can be considered an integration, and therefore the steady-state accuracy of a system ultimately depends on the number of integrations in the loop transfer function.",
